From 2318f069560f75dd6057ae3d6076a9cb00f99210 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mohamed Ashry <contact@atharapp.download>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:03:28 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] feat(ui): add catalog-ready scope labels and move the
 lagging stories to Bench/
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

SettingsScopeSentence gains optional globalLabel/projectLabel/globalHint/projectHint
props that default to today's English (D9), and its decorative glyph becomes
aria-hidden so the sentence is read once. FastModeToggle, ModelPicker and
SettingsScopeSentence move from Compounds/ to the Bench/ group every other
compound already uses (DS v2 §6). No rendered pixel moves.
---
